---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Partner With Boise Tree Pros | Exclusive Local Lead Channel"
  description="This website sends Treasure Valley tree jobs to one local company. See the real numbers."
  canonical="https://boisetreepro.com/partners/"
  ogTitle="Partner With Boise Tree Pros"
  ogDescription="This website sends Treasure Valley tree jobs to one local company. That spot is open."
  noindex={true}
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
<style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; color: #363636; background: #fff; margin: 0; }
    .nav-link { position: relative; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #363636; text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s; }
    .nav-link::after { content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: -3px; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px; background: #1A531A; transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: left; transition: transform 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.2, 0.64, 1); }
    .nav-link:hover { color: #1A531A; }
    .nav-link:hover::after { transform: scaleX(1); }
    .dropdown-open .blog-dropdown { opacity:1 !important; visibility:visible !important; transform:translateY(0) !important; }
    .areas-open .areas-dropdown { opacity:1 !important; visibility:visible !important; transform:translateY(0) !important; }
    .dropdown-open svg { transform: rotate(180deg); }
    .blog-dropdown a:hover { background: #f5f0eb; color: #1A531A; }
    .btn-primary { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: #1A531A; color: #FAF0E6; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 14px 28px; border: 2px solid #1A531A; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(26,83,26,0.25); }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: #2A6B2A; box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(26,83,26,0.35); transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .section-tag { display: inline-block; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8B5A2B; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .section-heading { font-family: 'Zilla Slab', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #1A531A; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
    #mobile-menu { display: none; }
    #mobile-menu.open { display: block; }
    .stat-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e8ddd0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px 24px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(26,83,26,0.06); }
    .stat-number { font-family: 'Zilla Slab', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(36px,4.5vw,48px); font-weight: 700; color: #1A531A; line-height: 1; }
    .stat-label { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #666; margin-top: 10px; }
    .step-number { font-family: 'Zilla Slab', Georgia, serif; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 700; color: rgba(26,83,26,0.2); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .partners-grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap: 24px; }
    @media (max-width: 900px) { .partners-grid-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
  </Fragment>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════
     HERO
══════════════════════════════════ -->
<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0F3010 0%, #1A531A 40%, #2A6B2A 100%);padding:80px 0 88px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
  <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 256 256%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noise%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.85%22 numOctaves=%224%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noise)%22 opacity=%220.04%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E');opacity:0.5;"></div>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 relative" style="z-index:1;">
    <div style="max-width:760px;">
      <span style="display:inline-block;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#87CEEB;margin-bottom:14px;">For tree professionals only</span>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Zilla Slab',Georgia,serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,52px);color:#FAF0E6;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:20px;">This Site Sends Tree Jobs to One Local Company.</h1>
      <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:rgba(250,240,230,0.85);max-width:640px;margin-bottom:14px;">boisetreepro.com ranks on Google for the searches Treasure Valley homeowners make when they're dealing with a tree — removal quotes, trimming costs, storm damage, dying trees. The calls and quote requests it generates go to a single partner company. That spot is open.</p>
      <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:rgba(250,240,230,0.6);max-width:640px;">Leads come from Boise, Meridian, Nampa, Caldwell, Eagle, and Garden City — your service area, not the other side of the state.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:32px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
        <a href="tel:+15093518404" class="btn-primary" style="background:#FAF0E6;color:#1A531A;border-color:#FAF0E6;">Call or Text (509) 351-8404</a>
        <a href="/#contact" class="btn-primary" style="background:transparent;color:#FAF0E6;border-color:rgba(250,240,230,0.5);box-shadow:none;">Send a Message</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════
     THE REAL NUMBERS
══════════════════════════════════ -->
<section style="background:#FAF0E6;padding:80px 0;">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <span class="section-tag">The Real Numbers</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.5vw,38px);margin-bottom:12px;">Straight From Google Search Console</h2>
    <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;max-width:640px;margin-bottom:40px;">Last 28 days, measured 2 August 2026. We'll screen-share the live dashboard on request — no screenshots, no cherry-picking.</p>
    <div class="partners-grid-3">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-number">5,274</div>
        <div class="stat-label">times shown in Google results to Treasure Valley homeowners searching for tree help — up 54% on the 28 days before</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-number">3&times;</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Google visits tripled in the last 28 days versus the month before (60 vs 20) — and still climbing</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-number">77</div>
        <div class="stat-label">pages of Boise-specific tree content: cost guides, permits, species problems, storm damage, city pages</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8ddd0;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;margin-top:24px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(26,83,26,0.06);">
      <p style="font-weight:600;color:#1A531A;margin:0 0 10px;font-size:16px;">Honest version, tree-guy to tree-guy:</p>
      <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#555;margin:0;">This is a young site on a steep climb — not yet a firehose. Homeowners researching "what does tree trimming cost in Boise" or "is my silver maple dangerous" land here, read a straight answer, and some pick up the phone or fill in the quote form. The volume grows every month the site ages. Getting in now means the flat rate gets set off today's numbers, not next spring's.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════
     HOW IT WORKS
══════════════════════════════════ -->
<section style="padding:80px 0;">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;">
      <span class="section-tag">How It Works</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.5vw,38px);">No Contract. No Setup Fee. No Card.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="partners-grid-3">
      <div>
        <div class="step-number">1</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Zilla Slab',Georgia,serif;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;color:#1A531A;margin-bottom:8px;">Leads forward to you</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;">Calls ring straight to your line and quote-form requests land in your inbox the minute they're sent. Every lead is logged, so you see exactly what the site produces. No dashboards to learn, no software to install.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="step-number">2</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Zilla Slab',Georgia,serif;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;color:#1A531A;margin-bottom:8px;">Your first leads are free</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;">Book the jobs, do the work, keep every dollar. We're not asking you to buy anything — we're asking you to answer the phone. If the leads aren't real Treasure Valley homeowners, hang up on us and you've lost nothing.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="step-number">3</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Zilla Slab',Georgia,serif;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;color:#1A531A;margin-bottom:8px;">Flat rate. One company only.</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;">If you like the leads, we agree on a flat monthly rate priced off the measured log — not a story. The site works for one company exclusively. Month to month, cancel any time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════
     WHY THIS BEATS ADS
══════════════════════════════════ -->
<section style="background:#FAF0E6;padding:80px 0;">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <span class="section-tag">The Math</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.5vw,38px);margin-bottom:24px;">Why This Beats Running Your Own Ads</h2>
    <div style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#555;max-width:760px;">
      <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Tree service clicks on Google Ads in the Boise market commonly run $10–$30 each, and most clicks never call. The traffic on this site comes from organic rankings built on months of content work — a position you can't buy and a competitor can't outbid you for.</p>
      <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">The site already answers the questions homeowners ask — removal costs, permits, dangerous species, storm cleanup — across 77 in-depth local pages. By the time someone calls, they've read what fair pricing looks like. These are warmer calls than any ad produces.</p>
      <p style="margin:0;">And because the rate is flat, your cost per job goes <em>down</em> every month the site grows — not up.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:40px;background:#1A531A;border-radius:16px;padding:40px 36px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
      <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 256 256%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noise%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.85%22 numOctaves=%224%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noise)%22 opacity=%220.04%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E');opacity:0.4;"></div>
      <div style="position:relative;z-index:1;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Zilla Slab',Georgia,serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,28px);color:#FAF0E6;margin:0 0 10px;">Taking On More Work This Season?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(250,240,230,0.8);margin:0 0 24px;max-width:520px;">Call or text and we'll have Treasure Valley homeowner leads coming to you this week. First ones are free — that's the whole pitch.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
          <a href="tel:+15093518404" class="btn-primary" style="background:#FAF0E6;color:#1A531A;border-color:#FAF0E6;">(509) 351-8404</a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="btn-primary" style="background:transparent;color:#FAF0E6;border-color:rgba(250,240,230,0.5);box-shadow:none;">Contact Form</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
